WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
08:00 — Grounding. Outside the exam hall Amina grounds on her phone — five things she can see, feet on the concrete — until her pulse is boring again.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
14:00 — Library laptop. Between papers she opens a quiet journal on the library laptop; no performance, just what her hands are doing.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
18:30 — Home tablet. At home the shared iPad gets a short Calm reset while her sister revises across the table.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
21:00 — Help is there. Phone shows locked crisis info exactly as shipped. She reads it once, calmly, and puts the phone away.

